or Fortive (NYSE:FTV) Stock Price","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-09","zh":"摩根大通對 Fortive (NYSE:FTV) 股價做出悲觀預測"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":5},{"name":"分析師評等","count":3},{"name":"併購","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-25","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1659166/000165916626000007/ftv-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Fortive Corporation innovates essential technologies to keep our world safe and productive. Our strategic segments - Intelligent Operating Solutions and Advanced Healthcare Solutions - include iconic inventor brands with leading positions in their markets. Our businesses design, develop, manufacture, and market products, software, and services, building upon leading brand names, innovative technologies, and strong market positions. We are headquartered in Everett, Washington and have a workforce of more than 10,000 research and development, manufacturing, sales, distribution, service, and administrative professionals in approximately 50 countries around the world.","zh":"Fortive Corporation 創新重要技術，以確保我們的世界安全和高效。我們的策略性細分市場——智慧營運解決方案和高級醫療保健解決方案——包括在市場中處於領先地位的標誌性發明品牌。我們的業務以領先的品牌、創新技術和強大的市場地位為基礎，設計、開發、製造和行銷產品、軟體和服務。我們的總部位於華盛頓州埃弗里特，在全球約 50 個國家/地區擁有 10,000 多名研發、製造、銷售、分銷、服務和管理專業人員。"},{"en":"On June 28, 2025, we separated our Precision Technologies segment business into an independent publicly-traded company (the \"Separation\") named Ralliant Corporation (\"Ralliant\"). The Separation was effected to qualify as a tax-free spin-off for Fortive shareholders for U.S. federal income tax purposes.","zh":"2025 年 6 月 28 日，我們將精密技術部門業務分拆為獨立的上市公司（「分拆」），名為 Ralliant Corporation（「Ralliant」）。此分拆是為了符合美國聯邦所得稅目的而對 Fortive 股東進行免稅分拆。"},{"en":"Fortive Corporation is a Delaware corporation and was incorporated in 2015 in connection with the separation of Fortive from Danaher Corporation (\"Danaher\" or \"Former Parent\") on July 2, 2016 as an independent, publicly-traded company, listed on the New York Stock Exchange.","zh":""}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Intelligent Operating Solutions","val":2856300000,"zh":"智慧營運解決方案"},{"name":"Advanced Healthcare Solutions","val":1302800000,"zh":"先進的醫療保健解決方案"}],"total":4159100000.0000005},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Product","val":3341300000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":817800000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":4159100000.0000005},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":2491100000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":730100000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"EMEA","val":725800000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Latin America","val":212100000,"zh":"拉丁美洲"}],"total":4159100000.0000005}},"peers":["ALLE","IEX","AME","MTD","VRSK"]}}